      "description": "mintAgainstCollateral prices the mint off a single pool's spot reserves and is reachable both directly and from the onFlashLoan callback. Within one flash-loaned transaction, an attacker can swap to skew the pool's price, then mint synthetic tokens at that manipulated price with no capital of their own at risk.",
